On the copper test link: Poll `show interface <test port> status` for up to 30 s, then read `show interface <test port>` and `show interface <partner port> status` on the partner.
TEST_CASE_REFERENCES
AWPTCM-T33235, 9001.33235.1
TEST_CASE_METHOD
On the copper test link: Poll `show interface <test port> status` for up to 30 s, then read `show interface <test port>` and `show interface <partner port> status` on the partner.
Verify: On the row whose first token is the test port, the status column reads `connected`, the duplex column is `a-` prefixed (e.g. `a-full`) and the speed column is `a-` prefixed (e.g. `a-1000`). `show interface <test port>` has a current line with a concrete `current duplex` and `current speed` value, not the literal `auto`. The partner row is also `connected` with `a-` prefixed values. Record the negotiated speed, duplex and `a-` prefixed tokens as the baseline.

